### PHASE 23: SNAPSHOT COMPLETENESS, INTEGRITY CHECK & STORAGE HYGIENE

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@adminToken = Bearer <ADMIN_JWT>
@superUserToken = Bearer <SUPERUSER_JWT>

### 1. Trigger Immediate Snapshot Save (schemaVersion: 2 + All Stateful Stores)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/system/snapshot
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}

### 2. Inspect Latest Snapshot Integrity Check Report (Super User Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system/integrity
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}

### 3. Re-run Live Snapshot Integrity Check On Demand (Super User Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system/integrity?refresh=true
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}

### 4. Integrity Endpoint Forbidden For Regular Admin (403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/system/integrity
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### 5. List Mentor Sessions Flagged needs_review (Admin 'reports' section or Super User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/mentor-sessions/needs-review
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### 6. Clear needs_review Integrity Flag With Mandatory Reason (409 on Replay)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/mentor-sessions/sess-flagged-1/clear-review
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Verified escrow payment ledger offline and approved settlement."
}

### 7. Trigger Hourly Jobs Tick (Executes storageHygieneJob & Records Detailed Counts)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/tick
Authorization: {{superUserToken}}

### 8. Inspect Job Run Details Including storageHygiene Counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/jobs/runs/<RUN_ID>
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
